#: ../../../CIR/index.md:103
msgid "History"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CIR/index.md:105
msgid ""
"ClangIR [started](https://github.com/facebookarchive/clangir) in October "
"2021. In June 2022, an [RFC](https://discourse.llvm.org/t/rfc-an-mlir-based-"
"clang-ir-cir/63319) proposing to incorporate the project — then in very "
"early stages — into llvm-project led to ClangIR becoming part of the LLVM "
"incubator, where development happened for the following years. In January "
"2024, the [upstreaming RFC](https://discourse.llvm.org/t/rfc-upstreaming-"
"clangir/76587) was accepted as the graduation step from the [incubator]"
"(https://github.com/llvm/clangir) (now archived), and ClangIR has been "
"developed directly upstream ever since, superseding the incubator in most "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
